#QLCIR-G1
# name: spin_multiaxis_m2_d3
# family: physics/spin-multiple-contexts
# expected: SAT
# physical: Abstract Stern-Gerlach / basis-change situation with several incompatible yes-no measurement contexts.
# note: Shared state violates classical decomposition with respect to each of 2 independently chosen dichotomic analyzer events.
dim(3)
output(11)
1 = and(state, axis0_plus)
2 = not(axis0_plus)
3 = and(state, 2)
4 = or(1, 3)
5 = not(4)
6 = and(state, axis1_plus)
7 = not(axis1_plus)
8 = and(state, 7)
9 = or(6, 8)
10 = not(9)
11 = and(state, 5, 10)
